/* =====================================================================
 * Raftaar - AI Lecture Notes & Quiz Engine        (src/VideoNotesMVP.tsx)
 *
 * Pipeline (1-3 ghante ke lectures ke liye):
 *   1. ANALYZE : video ko 10-min chunks mein todo, parallel (bounded) Gemini
 *                calls, har chunk ka concept-wise "digest" (verbatim nahi)
 *   2. OUTLINE : digests se chapters (text-only, halka)
 *   3. NOTES   : har chapter ke student-style notes + mind map + MCQs (parallel)
 *   4. IMAGES  : board ke important diagrams, video clip dekh kar AI se (optional)
 *
 * Har step ka result IndexedDB mein cache hota hai -> beech mein fail/refresh
 * ho toh dobara Generate dabane par wahin se resume hota hai.
 * ===================================================================== */
